OL,3,GNEWSAJohn Cleese urges St Andrews
OL,4,Astudents not to elect Q Manivannan as
OL,5,Arector
OL,6,
OL,7,FActor John Cleese has urged students
OL,8,Fnot to elect the Green MSP, Q
OL,9,FManivannan, as rector of the University
OL,10,Fof St Andrews due to the politician's
OL,11,Fcontroversial comments about rape.
OL,13,FIn a podcast last year, Manivannan
OL,14,Fspoke about the "demonisation of rape",
OL,15,Fadding that the crime existed on a
OL,16,F"spectrum".
OL,18,FCleese, a former rector at St Andrews,
OL,19,Faccused the MSP of trying to
OL,20,F"understate the appalling psychological
OL,21,Feffects of rape".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
